      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this fantastic, fully furnished 3 bed / 3 bath end of terrace house to the rental market, located in the Homeville Court development in Knocklyon, Dublin 16.\nThis spacious home is spread out over three floors, with two double bedrooms and one single, and three bathrooms including a downstairs WC, an ensuite and a main bathroom. There's ample parking to the front and an open outdoor area to the rear, and the property is available to move into immediately.\nIn terms of location, Knocklyon is a popular, well-established residential area on Dublin's southside, close to Knocklyon Village, Ballycullen and Templeogue, with a good range of local shops, schools and parks on the doorstep, along with easy access to the M50.\nFor public transport, there are various bus routes running from Knocklyon into the city centre and surrounding areas.\n1. Recently renovated\n2. Fully furnished throughout\n3. 3 bedrooms (2 double, 1 single)\n4. 3 bathrooms, including downstairs WC and ensuite\n5. Spread over three floors\n6. Ample parking to the front\n7. Open outdoor area to the rear\n8. Various Dublin Bus routes through Knocklyon\n9. Easy access to the M50\n10. Close to Knocklyon Village and Templeogue\nENQUIRIES BY EMAIL ONLY PLEASE."
      },
